      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I believe the reason a cutout variant is not provided is because transparency (which includes Alpha Cutout modes) is expensive on mobile hardware. I might be wrong, but I'm pretty sure any kind of shader variant that uses AlphaTest or AlphaBlend can cause issues when used too much.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "6472dd07c7ae6a08fe82f7c2",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5f9c811dc387de45f1a0af97",
        "alias": "Western Hedgehog",
        "aliasID": "65c2b3c3ed6eefce4cc3a261",
