  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-08-25T13:50:08.799Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Creating cross-compatible avatars for Quest is almost easy... except for the lack of a transparent shader we can use for avatar creation programs such as VRoid. Without it, it takes a lot of editing just to make VRoid avatars eyelashes and eyebrows not look like a nightmare.\n\nIf a cutout shader were included on VRchat's mobile shader list, all a user then has to do is a little decimation in Blender and then they're good to go.\n\nGreenlighting a cutout shader would increase the amount of content available for Quest users to pick from. Please consider this!",
